{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/terms/layout,_N_T_/terms/page,_N_T_/terms"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--JlqRGlKo7do21zOSFmcbS--><html lang=\"en\" class=\"__variable_c22fe1 __variable_538739 __variable_d758cf\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/98dcc76020b66359.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5f5800d9065ac0b9.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-ec67ac596534aad8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-59d88098b2f06625.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-5d5a01259796646a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/44530001-6233f3575f72737f.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/370-292ac9f8446dbc14.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-e859473b1b759a0a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/534-9126c6f48a0c58b7.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/not-found-5e2d368b27fed647.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Terms &amp; Conditions | Refly</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Read the terms and conditions governing the use of Refly.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"premium mens jeans india,luxury cargo pants,mens formal pants india,refly clothing,premium bottom wear india\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Refly — Move Different.\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Premium men&#x27;s bottom wear. Luxury quality, delivered across India.\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_IN\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://refly5428.builtwithrocket.new/assets/images/6391F31B-6325-43A2-8883-0AEF80565846-1785440876904.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Refly — Premium Men&#x27;s Bottom Wear\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Refly — Move Different.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Premium men&#x27;s bottom wear. Luxury quality, delivered across India.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://refly5428.builtwithrocket.new/assets/images/6391F31B-6325-43A2-8883-0AEF80565846-1785440876904.png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Refly — Premium Men&#x27;s Bottom Wear\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.cdnfonts.com/css/blue-fonte-sans\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"__className_538739\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-3\">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1><p class=\"text-gray-500 mb-10\">Last Updated: August 3, 2026</p><p class=\"mb-8 text-gray-700 leading-8\">Welcome to <strong>reflystore.in</strong>. By accessing or using our website, you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use our website.</p><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">1. Products</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">We strive to display our products accurately. How ever, slight variations in color or appearance may occur due to screen settings.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">2. Pricing</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">All prices are listed in Indian Rupees (INR) and are inclusive of applicable taxes unless stated otherwise. Prices may change without prior notice.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">3. Orders</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">Refly reserves the right to accept, reject, or cancel any order due to stock availability, pricing errors, suspected fraud, or other operational reasons.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">4. Payments</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">Payments are processed securely through trusted payment partners. Refly does not store your card or UPI credentials.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">5. Shipping &amp; Delivery</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">Delivery timelines are estimates and may vary depending on your location, courier service, and unforeseen circumstances.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">6. Returns &amp; Refunds</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">Returns and refunds are governed by our Returns Policy. Please review that page before requesting a return.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">7. Intellectual Property</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">All content on this website, including logos, text, graphics, images, and designs, is the property of Refly and may not be copied or used without written permission.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">8. Limitation of Liability</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">Refly shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of this website or our products.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">9. Contact Us</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-8\">For any questions regarding these Terms &amp; Conditions, please contact:</p><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700\"><p><strong>Refly</strong></p><p>Email: support@refly.store</p><p>Phone: +91 7760775621</p></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><div class=\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-[10000] flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-sm w-full pointer-events-none\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"false\"></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5f5800d9065ac0b9.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[5380,[\\\"730\\\",\\\"static/chunks/44530001-6233f3575f72737f.js\\\",\\\"370\\\",\\\"static/chunks/370-292ac9f8446dbc14.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-e859473b1b759a0a.js\\\"],\\\"AuthProvider\\\"]\\n3:I[7740,[\\\"730\\\",\\\"static/chunks/44530001-6233f3575f72737f.js\\\",\\\"370\\\",\\\"static/chunks/370-292ac9f8446dbc14.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-e859473b1b759a0a.js\\\"],\\\"CartProvider\\\"]\\n4:I[1559,[\\\"730\\\",\\\"static/chunks/44530001-6233f3575f72737f.js\\\",\\\"370\\\",\\\"static/chunks/370-292ac9f8446dbc14.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-e859473b1b759a0a.js\\\"],\\\"ToastProvider\\\"]\\n5:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n7:I[3486,[\\\"534\\\",\\\"static/chunks/534-9126c6f48a0c58b7.js\\\",\\\"345\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/not-found-5e2d368b27fed647.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nc:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/98dcc76020b66359.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"JlqRGlKo7do21zOSFmcbS\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"terms\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"terms\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/css/98dcc76020b66359.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\